  "scope": "The literal10000-slot program computes the original positive minimum and shifted row, restores the original adjacency/demand roots through its actual frame, and hands that exact returned row to the unchanged full packing solver. The optional returned state is exactly the original guess state for minimumPositive and the original dimension. Empty/all-zero inputs return actual absence. No index, minimum, labels, shifted costs, solver parameters or intermediate state are supplied. The same actual physical run retains original inputs/source and pays halt. The generic input bound retains exponent numerical dependence; the grid-range corollary derives a length-only envelope under the later loop invariant. Original represented input, H/B, dense cursor and exponent remain explicit. Old operation-counter equality, outer grid iteration and final dispatch-family composition remain separate. Eight physical cases and seven separately labelled natural-reference cases check absence or complete raw state fields/events against the original independent guess with literal selected indices, including padded costs/exponents and real directed demands."
}
